pic.cn/mmbiz_gif/4rjsgMLAKylbebs183obcpEicfSx9CRpibO5zPQd6FWqDRkUuIf4KbooMP6grvj8DKnHHXh8lR3WbcfPTPqu3J6g/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/4rjsgMLAKylbebs183obcpEicfSx9CRpibe9iaxVnORePPuohNEcbYxdKyfQap7QoJCfZPnJCo5OJ4txC6wVzU1bg/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/4rjsgMLAKylbebs183obcpEicfSx9CRpib3VbPSqVX623IEpTebOyjYO38lt56dSwsCPsVZo8PmUl83GCEZT3KMg/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/4rjsgMLAKylbebs183obcpEicfSx9CRpibv2nIPv5E9YwvH1Pwql31oibBZ85lFrPMC8ZA3zmNuNaKF98tmkySlRw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/4rjsgMLAKylbebs183obcpEicfSx9CRpibicejPhmnIburqicAeic4GE0zPjlcWFtjibyNYaQBzicraxnq9ORUpdBs8Vw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/4rjsgMLAKylbebs183obcpEicfSx9CRpibKRsOcDezD5gVQTv9Ojcf8hQGiaT6e9syHhessYhY0tDHOicxn0Wy1vCw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>心 火 花</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>新 视 野</span></b></p></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>2025年全国优秀大学生夏令营通知</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><span>亲爱的同学们：</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>北京协和医学院-中国医学科学院阜外医院（以下简称“阜外医院”）</span></strong><span>诚挚邀请您参加将于</span><span><strong><span>2025年8月中旬（拟定8月13日-16日）</span></strong></span><span>举办的“全国优秀大学生暑期夏令营”。我们期待与满怀医学热忱的你们相聚阜外！</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>本次夏令营的核心宗旨在于：</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>⭐拓展视野，启迪思想：</span></strong><span>帮助营员深入了解心血管领域前沿动态与阜外医院深厚的学术底蕴。</span></p><p><strong><span>⭐搭建桥梁，促进交流：</span></strong><span>为全国各高校优秀学子提供一个相互学习、共同成长的平台。</span></p><p><strong><span>⭐深度体验，感受氛围：</span></strong><span>让营员沉浸式体验阜外医院独特的学术环境、科研平台与文化魅力。</span></p><p><strong><span>⭐播种理想，共同成长：</span></strong><span>通过知识的分享、视野的开阔和思想的碰撞，对营员未来的医学之路产生积极而深远的影响。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><span>真诚欢迎来自全国各大高校、有临床及科研志向的</span><span><strong><span>2026届优秀本科毕业生</span></strong></span><span>！</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/4rjsgMLAKylbebs183obcpEicfSx9CRpib1xXkmiat7W9qLvevFMzw1W731hM7t1fGptUQ8iaiaAVfvX1XicfX20bVnw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/4rjsgMLAKylbebs183obcpEicfSx9CRpibPwjmbiadBhXC81fJvpdGnKnJBOfWpxEWF2RflTNj3KMxnaCoqRMxvOg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/4rjsgMLAKylbebs183obcpEicfSx9CRpibG53KUticn3iafSsmkbVhNZtOjwsecghy8voq9kEiaGibub2J4UEpSwssvA/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/4rjsgMLAKylbebs183obcpEicfSx9CRpibicejPhmnIburqicAeic4GE0zPjlcWFtjibyNYaQBzicraxnq9ORUpdBs8Vw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>中国医学科学院阜外医院</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>阜外医院是集医疗、科研、预防和人才培养于一体的国家级三级甲等心血管病专科医院，也是国家心血管病中心、心血管疾病全国重点实验室、国家心血管疾病临床医学研究中心所在地。</span></p><p><span>更多医院详情见链</span><span><span>接：</span></span><span><span>https://www.fuwai.com/Hospitals/Main/Description</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><span>更多专家详情详见：https://yzbss.pumc.edu.cn/basicinfo/tutorinfo/tutorcollege/002。</span></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/4rjsgMLAKylbebs183obcpEicfSx9CRpibicbyAz6UDwuM2bOU2kW0Vd3gMJTIxbvBo2yRDCxnG2EchghQqTdRALw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>一、申请资格（须同时满足）</span></strong></p></section></section><section><p><strong><span>1、品德为先，身心健康：</span></strong></p><p><span> 拥护中国共产党的领导，热爱祖国，遵纪守法、诚实守信、品行端正、身心健康。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>2、学业优异</span></strong><span><span>：</span></span></p><p><span>截至本科当前学业成绩综合排名在全年级名列前茅，英语水平良好。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>3、志趣明确：</span></strong></p><p><span>对医学研究（基础或临床）有浓厚兴趣，具有强烈的从事学术研究或临床探索的意愿。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><p><strong><span>二、申请方式及提交材料</span></strong></p></section></section><section><p><span><span>2025年7月15日至7月27日中午12:00期间开放报名唯一入口：https://www.wjx.cn/vm/hZyaCu0.aspx#</span></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/4rjsgMLAKylbebs183obcpEicfSx9CRpibWfp7vSicGkBkyj6uU6mIicBXFiaFdBW8IAW0LggOMBqkZoicomkU1fAHJg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>注：请务必在规定时间内完成线上报名。提交的申请材料原件需在报到时进行现场审核。</span></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>三、入选通知</span></strong></p></section></section><section><p><span><span>入选结果将于</span><span><strong><span>2025年8月初</span></strong></span><span>通过</span><strong><span><span>阜外教学官方公众号</span></span></strong><span>正式发布，请申请者密切关注，确保预留联系方式畅通。</span></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><p><strong><span>四、日程安排</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/4rjsgMLAKylbebs183obcpEicfSx9CRpibxlb3qW0TmfMlhv52WZeIOqoRcvAgWXyy90BLonia8ghx9ovdgHklq8A/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>(具体安排以实际入营后通知为准)</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><p><strong><span>五、营员待遇</span></strong></p></section></section><section><p><span><span>⭐本次夏令营不收取任何注册费。</span></span></p><p><span><span>⭐为所有入选营员免费提供夏令营期间</span></span><span><span>（第一天晚至第四天中午）的食宿。</span></span></p><p><span><span>⭐往返交通费需营员自理。</span></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><p><strong><span>六、其他说明</span></strong></p></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><strong><span>1、遵守纪律：</span></strong><span> 入营营员需严格遵守阜外医院各项管理规定，服从夏令营统一安排。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>2、全程参与：</span></strong><span> 营员需全程参加夏令营所有活动。擅自离营者，将取消入营资格和营员待遇。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><p><strong><span>七、联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><span>关于本次暑期夏令营活动，如有任何疑问，请联系阜外医院教育处，010-88398591 （工作日 8:00-11:00,14:00-17:00）。</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>我们期待与优秀的你相遇，共同探索心血管医学的奥秘与未来！</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>中</span><span><span>国医学科学院阜外医院</span></span></p><p><span><span>教育处</span></span></p><p><span><span>2025年7月15日</span></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section><section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/4rjsgMLAKylbebs183obcpEicfSx9CRpibocUIpwUOmdbJkIqNsThgCwGkNTUZiaaOHrJnicAKghAbfzxTRwGseQuQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/4rjsgMLAKylbebs183obcpEicfSx9CRpibf4CsPMu9xtzt5410UjV5n1XPNuLabQCSQf1SyejNordiafJgLeYRlqg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>我们期待与满怀医学热忱的你们</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>在这个夏天相聚在阜外医院！</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/4rjsgMLAKylbebs183obcpEicfSx9CRpib1xXkmiat7W9qLvevFMzw1W731hM7t1fGptUQ8iaiaAVfvX1XicfX20bVnw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></sec